  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/emmo#Btu_It_Per_Deg_F">
    <emmo:EMMO_967080e5_2f42_4eb2_a3a9_c58143e835f9 xml:lang="en">British Thermal Unit (IT) Per Fahrenheit Degree (Btu (IT)/°F) is a measure of heat capacity. It can be converted to the corresponding standard SI unit J/K by multiplying its value by a factor of 1899.10534.

