    <emmo:EMMO_705f27ae_954c_4f13_98aa_18473fc52b25 xml:lang="en">Coined by Stanisław Leśniewski in 1927, from Ancient Greek μέρος (méros, “part”) +‎ -logy (“study, discussion, science”).
