    <emmo:EMMO_31252f35_c767_4b97_a877_1235076c3e13 xml:lang="en">A causal particle represents the most elementary entity in physics, being it a simple state of an elementary particle, called quantum in the EMMO, or a chain of causally connected quanta.</emmo:EMMO_31252f35_c767_4b97_a877_1235076c3e13>
