    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A causal particle represents the most elementary entity in physics, being it a simple state of an elementary particle, called quantum in the EMMO, or a chain of causally connected quanta.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The disjoint union of CausalPath and Quantum classes.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The class of individuals representing causal particles.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">CausalParticle</rdfs:label>
    <emmo:EMMO_967080e5_2f42_4eb2_a3a9_c58143e835f9 xml:lang="en">The class of individuals representing causal particles.</emmo:EMMO_967080e5_2f42_4eb2_a3a9_c58143e835f9>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">CausalParticle</skos:prefLabel>
  </rdf:Description>
