  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/emmo#Barye">
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The barye, or sometimes barad, barrie, bary, baryd, baryed, or barie, is the centimetre-gram-second (CGS) unit of pressure. It is equal to 1 dyne per square centimetre.

-- QUDT</rdfs:comment>
