    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Metre</skos:prefLabel>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The metre, symbol m, is the SI unit of length. It is defined by taking the fixed numerical value of the speed of light in vacuum c to be 299792458 when expressed in the unit m s−1, where the second is defined in terms of ∆νCs.</rdfs:comment>
    <emmo:EMMO_6dd685dd_1895_46e4_b227_be9f7d643c25 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI">http://dbpedia.org/resource/Metre</emmo:EMMO_6dd685dd_1895_46e4_b227_be9f7d643c25>
