    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The mass that it seems to have when responding to forces, or the mass that it seems to have when interacting with other identical particles in a thermal distribution.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">EffectiveMass</skos:prefLabel>
