    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <skos:example xml:lang="en">CFC is a 'sign' that stands for the fact that the morphology of atoms composing the microstructure of an entity is predominantly Cubic Face Centered

A color is a nominal property.

Sex of a human being.</skos:example>
  </rdf:Description>
