    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Month</skos:prefLabel>
    <emmo:EMMO_967080e5_2f42_4eb2_a3a9_c58143e835f9 xml:lang="en">A unit of time corresponding approximately to one cycle of the moon's phases, or about 30 days or 4 weeks. Also known as the 'Synodic Month' and calculated as 29.53059 days.

