    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Joule Per Square Meter (J/m²) is a unit in the category of Energy density. It is also known as joules per square meter, joule per square metre, joule/square meter, joule/square metre. This unit is commonly used in the SI unit system.

-- QUDT</rdfs:comment>
