    <emmo:EMMO_967080e5_2f42_4eb2_a3a9_c58143e835f9 xml:lang="en">The pressure measured relative to the ambient atmospheric pressure.</emmo:EMMO_967080e5_2f42_4eb2_a3a9_c58143e835f9>
