  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/emmo#CentiMetre">
    <emmo:EMMO_967080e5_2f42_4eb2_a3a9_c58143e835f9 xml:lang="en">A centimetre is a unit of length in the metric system, equal to one hundredth of a metre, which is the SI base unit of length. Centi is the SI prefix for a factor of 10.  The centimetre is the base unit of length in the now deprecated centimetre-gram-second (CGS) system of units.

-- QUDT</emmo:EMMO_967080e5_2f42_4eb2_a3a9_c58143e835f9>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
