    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Manufacturing</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The process of transforming precursor objects (e.g. raw materials) into a product by the use of manual labor, machinery or chemical/biological processes.</rdfs:comment>
