    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Relates a battery functional role to a material that fills that role in a cell. Applies to all four BatteryRole subclasses, including ElectrolyteRole and SeparatorRole. Independent of belongsToElectrode since v0.3.2: the two are no longer declared owl:inverseOf, because that inverse propagated belongsToElectrode's electrode-only range onto this property's subjects.</rdfs:comment>
