    <skos:example xml:lang="en">Hardness is a subclass of properties.
Vickers hardness is a subclass of hardness that involves the procedures and instruments defined by the standard hardness test.</skos:example>
    <skos:example xml:lang="en">The name "red" which is atomic in the code made of the list of colors.</skos:example>
