    <emmo:EMMO_33ae2d07_5526_4555_a0b4_8f4c031b5652 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">rad.s-2</emmo:EMMO_33ae2d07_5526_4555_a0b4_8f4c031b5652>
    <emmo:EMMO_7f1dec83_d85e_4e1b_b7bd_c9442d4f5a64 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">rad/s²</emmo:EMMO_7f1dec83_d85e_4e1b_b7bd_c9442d4f5a64>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">RadianPerSquareSecond</skos:prefLabel>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Angular acceleration is the rate of change of angular velocity. In SI units, it is measured in radians per Square second (rad/s²), and is usually denoted by the Greek letter α.

-- QUDT</rdfs:comment>
