    <emmo:EMMO_c7b62dd7_063a_4c2a_8504_42f7264ba83f xml:lang="en">A material process requires the output to be classified as an individual of a material subclass.</emmo:EMMO_c7b62dd7_063a_4c2a_8504_42f7264ba83f>
