    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Kilogram per cubic metre is an SI derived unit of density, defined by mass in kilograms divided by volume in cubic metres. The official SI symbolic abbreviation is kg . m⁻³, or equivalently either kg/m³.

-- QUDT</rdfs:comment>
