    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A 'Mathematical' that has no unknown value, i.e. all its 'Variable"-s parts refers to a 'Number' (for scalars that have a built-in datatype) or to another 'Numerical' (for complex numerical data structures that should rely on external implementations).</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
