    <emmo:EMMO_c7b62dd7_063a_4c2a_8504_42f7264ba83f xml:lang="en">Position vectors are so-called bounded vectors, i.e. their magnitude and direction depend on the particular coordinate system used.

-- ISO 80000-3</emmo:EMMO_c7b62dd7_063a_4c2a_8504_42f7264ba83f>
    <emmo:EMMO_c7b62dd7_063a_4c2a_8504_42f7264ba83f xml:lang="en">In the usual geometrical three-dimensional space, position vectors are quantities of the dimension length.

-- IEC</emmo:EMMO_c7b62dd7_063a_4c2a_8504_42f7264ba83f>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
