    <emmo:EMMO_c7b62dd7_063a_4c2a_8504_42f7264ba83f xml:lang="en">Metallic materials are known for their shiny luster, excellent electrical/thermal conductivity, malleability (shapable by hammering), and ductility (can be drawn into wires), due to metallic bonding (shared electrons); they often form alloys (like steel from iron/carbon) to enhance these properties for diverse applications.</emmo:EMMO_c7b62dd7_063a_4c2a_8504_42f7264ba83f>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">MetallicMaterial</skos:prefLabel>
