    <emmo:EMMO_c7b62dd7_063a_4c2a_8504_42f7264ba83f xml:lang="en">The proper part relation has the following pair-covering sub-relations:
- hasMembers xor hasPiece
- hasPortionPart xor hasGatheredPart
. hasItemPart xor hasScatteredPart</emmo:EMMO_c7b62dd7_063a_4c2a_8504_42f7264ba83f>
    <emmo:EMMO_967080e5_2f42_4eb2_a3a9_c58143e835f9 xml:lang="en">The relation between an entity and one of its parts, when both entities are distinct.</emmo:EMMO_967080e5_2f42_4eb2_a3a9_c58143e835f9>
