    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">LongTonPerCubicYard</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The long ton per cubic yard density measurement unit is used to measure volume in cubic yards in order to estimate weight or mass in long tons.

-- QUDT</rdfs:comment>
