    <emmo:EMMO_967080e5_2f42_4eb2_a3a9_c58143e835f9 xml:lang="en">The long ton per cubic yard density measurement unit is used to measure volume in cubic yards in order to estimate weight or mass in long tons.

-- QUDT</emmo:EMMO_967080e5_2f42_4eb2_a3a9_c58143e835f9>
