    <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/emmo/disciplines/metrology#"/>
    <emmo:EMMO_967080e5_2f42_4eb2_a3a9_c58143e835f9 xml:lang="en">Result of a measurement.

A set of quantity values being attributed to a measurand (quantity) together with any other available relevant information, like measurement uncertainty.

-- VIM</emmo:EMMO_967080e5_2f42_4eb2_a3a9_c58143e835f9>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/emmo#EMMO_2a888cdf_ec4a_4ec5_af1c_0343372fc978"/>
