    <emmo:EMMO_967080e5_2f42_4eb2_a3a9_c58143e835f9 xml:lang="en">Energy to be added to or removed from a system under constant temperature and pressure to undergo a complete phase transition.</emmo:EMMO_967080e5_2f42_4eb2_a3a9_c58143e835f9>
