  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/emmo#EMMO_ad0e72fc_dcaa_490d_8371_b4d814dcda2c">
    <emmo:EMMO_31252f35_c767_4b97_a877_1235076c3e13 xml:lang="en">Causality is the fundamental concept describing how entities affect each other, and conceptually precedes time and space relations. In the EMMO causality is the foundation for space and time relations.
Embracing a strong reductionistic view, causality originates at quantum entities level, meaning that causal relations between macroscopic entities is simply the sum of quantum level causality relations.</emmo:EMMO_31252f35_c767_4b97_a877_1235076c3e13>
    <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/emmo/foundation/mereocausality#"/>
    <emmo:EMMO_c7b62dd7_063a_4c2a_8504_42f7264ba83f xml:lang="en">Each pair of entities is either in isCauseOf or isNotCauseOf relation. The two are mutually exclusive.</emmo:EMMO_c7b62dd7_063a_4c2a_8504_42f7264ba83f>
    <emmo:EMMO_c7b62dd7_063a_4c2a_8504_42f7264ba83f xml:lang="en">Causality in the EMMO is intended as physical causation and not counter-factual. Meaning that causality is an expression of actual physical interactions, and not of a counterfactual depence such as “I didn't water the flowers, hence, I'm the cause of their death”.</emmo:EMMO_c7b62dd7_063a_4c2a_8504_42f7264ba83f>
    <emmo:EMMO_967080e5_2f42_4eb2_a3a9_c58143e835f9 xml:lang="en">The superclass of all causal EMMO relations.</emmo:EMMO_967080e5_2f42_4eb2_a3a9_c58143e835f9>
    <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/emmo#EMMO_ec2472ae_cf4a_46a5_8555_1556f5a6c3c5"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The superclass of all causal EMMO relations.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Causality is the fundamental concept describing how entities affect each other, and conceptually precedes time and space relations. In the EMMO causality is the foundation for space and time relations.
Embracing a strong reductionistic view, causality originates at quantum entities level, meaning that causal relations between macroscopic entities is simply the sum of quantum level causality relations.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">causal</skos:prefLabel>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">causal</rdfs:label>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"/>
  </rdf:Description>
