    <emmo:EMMO_967080e5_2f42_4eb2_a3a9_c58143e835f9 xml:lang="en">A variable standing for a numerical defined mathematical object like e.g. a number, a vector of numbers, a matrix of numbers.</emmo:EMMO_967080e5_2f42_4eb2_a3a9_c58143e835f9>
